      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARD COMPASS (7) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 2.75 lengths into third (25.62) at Shepparton in a Rank Limit - Grade 5 over 450m. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Rates highly and will give a great sight. MR. JONES (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (24.38) at this track behind Angry Chief in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Leading player again. PEAKY COLLINDA (6) spotted a start but wound up strongly late and finished third and beaten 2.75 lengths (24.30) at this track in Grade 4/5. Overdue and expected to feature again. PAW AMARLI (1) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
